{
  "about": "A schema link types a stored artifact from its producing specification's output contract (INPUT-3, INPUT-10, INPUT-11, FILE-3, OUTPUT-9): a check of the consumer reads the producer's specification and no data, the consumer reads the file at its own path, which the caller builds and saves first, and never runs the producer; a header or schema other than the producer's output fails; a consumer may write no file of its producer; and a linked ordinal is the consumer's own field. The producer counts the seven records of one subject into one; the consumer counts the records of each stored row. Moved from file_producer_links.rs, whose tests compared the saved bytes, the fields each case's compares names, and that a failed build had no output, which the report's column kind with no row states (CHECK-23 gives a column row to a successful run only).",
  "documents": {
    "producer": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\ndomain: COUNTED\nkeys: [ID]\ninput: {RAW: {path: ../raw/raw.csv, types: {ID: int, VALUE: int}}}\nrows:\n  - id: counted\n    dataset: RAW\n    group_by: [RAW.ID]\n    derivations: {ID: RAW.ID, VALUE: {aggregate: 'COUNT(RAW.*)'}}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: ID, type: int, label: Identifier}\n  - {name: VALUE, type: int, label: Count}\noutput: {path: ../generated/producer.csv, columns: [ID, VALUE]}\n",
    "consumer": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\ndomain: ROOT\nkeys: [ID]\ninput: {FIRST: {path: ../generated/producer.csv, schema: ../producer/p.yaml}}\nrows:\n  - id: counted\n    dataset: FIRST\n    group_by: [FIRST.ID, FIRST.VALUE]\n    derivations: {ID: FIRST.ID, SOURCE_COUNT: FIRST.VALUE, VALUE: {aggregate: 'COUNT(FIRST.*)'}}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: ID, type: int, label: Identifier}\n  - {name: SOURCE_COUNT, type: int, label: Original source count}\n  - {name: VALUE, type: int, label: Count}\noutput: {path: ../generated/root.csv, columns: [ID, SOURCE_COUNT, VALUE]}\n",
    "raw": "ID,VALUE\n1,1\n1,2\n1,3\n1,4\n1,5\n1,6\n1,7\n"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "a_consumer_of_a_csv_artifact_checks_against_its_producers_specification_without_data",
      "operation": "check",
      "input": {"files": {"raw/raw.csv": {"base": "raw"}, "producer/p.yaml": {"base": "producer"}, "consumer/root.yaml": {"base": "consumer"}}, "specification": "consumer/root.yaml"},
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "case": "a_consumer_check_refuses_a_field_its_linked_producer_does_not_output",
      "operation": "check",
      "input": {"files": {"raw/raw.csv": {"base": "raw"}, "producer/p.yaml": {"base": "producer"}, "consumer/root.yaml": {"base": "consumer", "edits": [{"from": "SOURCE_COUNT: FIRST.VALUE", "to": "SOURCE_COUNT: FIRST.MISSING"}]}}, "specification": "consumer/root.yaml"},
      "issues": [{"phase": "validation", "condition": "unknown_field", "rule": "NAME-3", "spec_paths": ["rows.counted.derivations.SOURCE_COUNT.source"], "context": {"identifier": "FIRST.MISSING"}}]
    },
    {
